sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Buyer
    participant Haya as Haya Checkout
    participant Quote as Quote service
    participant Payment as Mock payment (Simulated)
    participant Supplier as Store / supplier
    participant Ops as Haya operations

    Buyer->>Haya: Confirm cart, address, and shipping choice
    Haya->>Quote: Validate eligible products and calculate quote
    Quote-->>Haya: Versioned, expiring quote
    alt Quote is valid
        Haya->>Payment: Start current demo payment
        Note right of Payment: Simulated success only\nNo bank or PSP transaction
        Payment-->>Haya: Simulated payment recorded
        Haya->>Haya: Create parent order and store sub-orders
        Haya->>Supplier: Send supplier sub-order
        alt Supplier accepts
            Supplier-->>Haya: Accepted with fulfillment route
            Haya->>Ops: Queue operational follow-up
            Haya-->>Buyer: Order and shipment updates
        else Supplier rejects or cannot supply
            Supplier-->>Haya: Rejection reason
            Haya-->>Buyer: Choose available items or cancel all
        end
    else Quote is stale or invalid
        Haya-->>Buyer: Refresh cart or shipping selection
    end
    Note over Haya,Payment: Live payment requires PSP selection, credentials,\nmarket approval, and verified authorization/capture/refund/webhooks.
